# Ignore every package directory by default -- VPM re-downloads the ones it manages.
#
# This catch-all MUST stay ABOVE the un-ignore rules below. Git applies the LAST matching
# pattern, and it cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded. When `/*/` sat
# after `!com.merlin.UdonSharp/`, the catch-all won: every *new* file added under our own
# package was silently ignored, while previously-tracked files kept showing up as modified
# (gitignore does not affect tracked files). That made an entire feature look committed when
# none of its new source files were in the index.
/*/

# ...except the packages this repository actually owns or has to pin.
!/com.merlin.UdonSharp/
!/com.vrchat.core.vpm-resolver/

# Unity/VPM manifests live directly under Packages/ and are always kept.
!/manifest.json
!/packages-lock.json
!/vpm-manifest.json
